<title>华为尊界刹车踏板断裂，官媒批“不说人话”被删；华为粉丝怒斥人民日报据港媒报道懂车帝发布测试视频，三辆全新尊界V800在时</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10332</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10332</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:09:53 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>华为尊界刹车踏板断裂，官媒批“不说人话”被删；华为粉丝怒斥人民日报</b><br/><br/>据港媒报道懂车帝发布测试视频，三辆全新尊界V800在时速100公里紧急刹车时，刹车踏板支架均断裂，且位置与形态高度一致；10日，新疆官方账号“新疆发布”发文促车企正面回应安全质疑，一度登上热搜榜首，随后却显示“无法查看内容”。“浙江宣传”指出，消费者“没有看到更权威的声音，却看到一个个帖子消失不见”。<br/><br/>11日，人民日报发文称刹车踏板“绝不应该在驾驶中出现‘断裂’”。学者魏武挥对《联合早报》称，此文意味着事件“上升到决策层”，预计华为或改变为合作企业深度背书的策略。<br/><br/>据李老师不是你老师截图，有华为粉丝怒斥人民日报为“汉奸媒体”“二流报纸”；另有自媒体批有媒体呼吁“给民族工业一点时间”，将质量问题升到了民族企业的高度。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80">#科技</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%94%B5%E5%8A%A8%E8%BD%A6">#电动车</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5">#审查</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《香港01》<a href="https://www.hk01.com/%E5%8D%B3%E6%99%82%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B/60398343/%E8%8F%AF%E7%82%BA%E5%B0%8A%E7%95%8C%E7%85%9E%E8%BB%8A%E8%B8%8F%E6%9D%BF%E6%94%AF%E6%9E%B6%E6%96%B7%E8%A3%82%E6%83%B9%E8%AD%B0-%E6%96%B0%E7%96%86%E5%AE%98%E5%AA%92%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E6%89%B9-%E4%B8%8D%E8%AA%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%A9%B1-%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%AA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">华为尊界煞车踏板支架断裂惹议 新疆官媒文章批｢不说人话｣被删</a><br/>《浙江宣传》<a href="https://news.ifeng.com/c/8x9dfF9dIIE" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">尊界V800风波需要一个真相</a><br/>《人民日报》<a href="https://app.xinhuanet.com/news/article.html?articleId=202610112c9d9de0e4184f17ae8e24440c189a6b" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">四部门联手，对“速成车”说不</a><br/>《联合早报》<a href="https://www.zaobao.com.sg/news/china/story20261011-9819986" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">华为陷刹车踏板支架断裂争议后 中国官方整治“速成车”</a><br/>《李老师不是你老师》<a href="https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2109584874382168272" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">10月11日，《人民日报》发文关注尊界刹车踏板支架断裂事件……</a><br/>《亮见》<a href="https://chinadigitaltimes.net/chinese/732811.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">给民族工业一点时间，谁给生命一个机会？</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/Gck2QYUzaDA_iE4ZtuIr766nReydhyd6SKGEjm_y4Nl7HElgmGAt_RQ7NDX63vXQrk9ZKPrPukK-m8JOiT0k5LvsbQ8a4qTWaMKH9NKuigA7Cly4tAOi7JT8Eg1ORq0UMBCGbqmIkXGAIO2u_qdRcZE9PcFWr1v8dummmctwfPWoKvjXkXEEtBR6JCWLf4FX0TB4Gn60ad8zAt7AKGEHY9Vem5K9nM2xKRWRAUCd-1S65RI5M9LxoIsPLN68yXgMMUQ_X9O-71k5Yscqc42sIhbKGv_Edzl-dj6e3UZNWo5t0ARREKiweSqa5YjkAxKVXWlAPiJBr_XmZf4H0DKL9A.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/fKK0clPsSU0YhtMh9_MEBoKphxah9kC3Y62GQLTS52wfy_G4zFFXI4ntj1LZlY2bolXmsNaKeTzRbtGXDn4foaEAw8hq1H4ZpA2mkRwGAssS6dVYBalrMsAnNZ6dA0U2OTABGjxhldUfLjzUjaJPCPX11fCnI5QoViYT_IuvZ2zGQh-3NjIewaOccVgCOg85OHScgtNpbvQ77J8l9283gqZ4cfMfhwBIrOzWNBE1yZmAHiMhqDhXqxNd1Eo9X9hvhbcFOwcL3OUGSMSnInCTiaunDJFL7nfztlYqGUVWhtR_aW_w4t5tk-WSVEZtbEuLizYdwDompJWd-mU0kzqZYw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/JGA5u6DnzUnSYICR0B3Ilva4bjX1APw6zZcMHpjqZt5fgRVR6z2GClO3gOPjqmMeeY-3SoHvseGjMn4-rWxVRr5AttJ_1kHIlxfOzFFbZ2k3AVqC4QpKBhJvjDvlXtu32ked6sx-313i4a9EG02YQNPc1GJsy-UiGh0hI5zpp-hZrtwhvOhktBUvR6Fe6tTNjvYyRK7cVs1vgyxZJWZa8LbPda2upmVzqyM369Sr5H0OnLPYW_Ey5pXT_25hVcgJThkgXEGYtol1vfoguyCB7OHzynhm123KHlbOOr26MHOWd7QeYY6QGrZpkjPXNJKaFdB-SQfcxir-0iu6mfYixw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/flY0Tlxpjn2l2bD_nOWYks26MuDQLKgbwHGk8orQG7AbY-fnTVn5s11ks6EuzGKL7VT_uptGlqhO6sz6ZoM-wcKjY5uEu7mFn5mbaGtgFywxOwZOH3_0RshWcacBF9UbP5J3M77xx0vssFiJ4Lnr_EuaZt9_FPfig26iAT2nz6Q26MwuSbShE6FoBK9qdgzSl9oJe4ExrFd7RGQot-_YXzGuPxUFlw4pdZR0L-oaRrSnQ2FP5w4lw4AwpaWhpWBssnAHC6pIezeOSJyOhaH_